  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'The grid is national now, and you run the Midlands from Central Dispatch.
    The cities'' motors and mills draw more than real power: watch each city''s power
    factor and voltage, and put capacitor banks where they sag. The relays will shed
    load to save the grid if they must.'
